OL,3,GNEWSAUkrainian doctor rebuilds career
OL,4,Athrough volunteering
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ukrainian doctor who left her home
OL,7,Fcountry before Russia's full-scale
OL,8,Finvasion hopes to return to practising
OL,9,Fmedicine after volunteering at a stroke
OL,10,Frehabilitation unit.
OL,12,FOlena Ipek, 30, has spent the past nine
OL,13,Fmonths at Westbrook House in Margate
OL,14,Fwhile studying for the exams needed to
OL,15,Fqualify as a doctor in the UK.
OL,17,FShe said adjusting to life in England
OL,18,Fhad been challenging, with language
OL,19,Fbarriers and cultural differences
OL,20,Fmaking it difficult to navigate an
OL,21,Funfamiliar healthcare system.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
