OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUkrainian doctor rebuilds career
OL,4,Athrough volunteering
OL,5,
OL,6,FIpek said: "When I see the patients
OL,7,Fimproving I see that it is worth my
OL,8,Ftime. We play games, do crafts, talk
OL,9,Fwith them and spend time with them. It
OL,10,Fmakes them happy being with us
OL,11,Fvolunteers."
